    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "common freshwater goby (Gymnogobius urotaenia)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "川の石の下をそっとめくると、浮鮴が素早く泳ぎ去った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "浮鮴は砂礫底を好む魚で、清流に近い中流域に多く生息する。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "地元の子供たちは浮鮴をタモで捕まえ、バケツに入れて持ち帰った。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "floating goby (Gymnogobius petschiliensis)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "河口の干潟で採集したサンプルに浮鮴（ペチリエンシス）が含まれており、研究者は驚いた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "浮鮴は汽水域にも適応できる種で、海に近い川の下流でも観察される。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "浮鮴の分布域を調べた論文が、国内の淡水魚研究誌に掲載された。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "Gymnogobius opperiens (fish)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "浮鮴（オッペリエンス）の生態はほとんど解明されておらず、標本の数も少ない。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "専門家は浮鮴の形態的特徴を詳細に記録し、近縁種との違いを明らかにした。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "その水系で浮鮴が採れたのは初めての記録で、研究チームは興奮を隠せなかった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "gloss": "isaza goby (Gymnogobius isaza)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "琵琶湖固有種の浮鮴は冬に産卵のため深場から浮き上がり、漁の対象となる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "浮鮴の佃煮は琵琶湖周辺の名産品で、観光客に人気がある。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "環境変化の影響で浮鮴の漁獲量が年々減少しており、保護の必要性が議論されている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
